<title>POLAND: KRAKCHEMIA SEES 1997 NET UP 8-27 PCT.</title>
<headline>KRAKCHEMIA SEES 1997 NET UP 8-27 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish retailer Krakchemia SA sees its net profit rising by between eight and 27 percent to between 1.1 and 1.3 million zlotys in 1997, the company said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Krakchemia said its sales were likely to grow 18 percent to 153.5 million zlotys.</p>
<p>The company also said it planned to invest 22.3 million zlotys in 1997.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
